@startuml 02_activity
title GradPath AI - Activity Diagram: Student applies for a job
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #EEF2FF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #6366F1

|Student|
start
:Sign in;
if (Profile onboarded?) then (no)
  :Complete onboarding form;
  |System|
  :Validate profile & store;
  :Evaluate 60 readiness rules\nand save history record;
  |Student|
else (yes)
endif
:Open Job Opportunities;
|System|
:Rank open listings by skill match;
|Student|
:Choose a listing and open details;
:Fill application (phone, availability,\nlink, cover note, consent) and attach PDF;
|System|
if (Listing open?) then (no)
  :Show "position closed";
  stop
endif
if (Already applied?) then (yes)
  :Show "already applied";
  stop
endif
:Validate form fields;
:Check PDF signature, size, pages;\nextract text with PDFBox;
if (Valid?) then (no)
  |Student|
  :See validation errors and correct them;
  stop
else (yes)
  |System|
  :Compute fit = 55% skill + 25% resume\n+ 20% readiness points;
  :Save application + resume PDF;
  :Publish ActivityEvent ("Applied for a job");
endif
|Career Officer|
:Review ranked applications;
:Open application & resume;
:Update status;
|Student|
:See new status in tracker;
stop
@enduml
